WEBVTT

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.940
<b>Kishuu Province</b>

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.760
Do not weep.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:49.080
Soon, you will be in paradise.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.450
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:58.460
Is that all you have saved, Brother?

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.790
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Miyoshi Seikai Nyuudou</b>

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.900
Praise to Amida Buddha.

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:05.800
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Miyoshi Isa Nyuudou</b>

00:02:01.460 --> 00:02:06.250
I have already saved twenty.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:09.810
The number is not what is important.

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:13.660
The task of destroying this village

00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:17.250
was given to us by our master, Yukimura-sama.

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:20.550
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Yuri Kamanosuke</b>

00:02:15.210 --> 00:02:20.550
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Kakei Juuzou</b>

00:02:18.990 --> 00:02:20.020
Indeed.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:26.080
These are more than enough corpses.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:28.700
Then, take care of it, Anayama-dono.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:31.080
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Anayama Kosuke</b>

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:30.220
Very well.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:35.330
Justice!

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:44.430
The bloody beacon of the Ten Crucifix Insects.

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:47.930
May it reach Yukimura-sama.

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:56.940
<b>To Kishuu! 
The Ten Crucifix Insects of Sanada Appear!</b>

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.450
<b>Edo Castle</b>

00:02:59.020 --> 00:03:02.410
Here's the report on the Insect-man that attacked Edo.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:05.410
<b>Eighth Shogun 
Tokugawa Yoshimune</b>

00:03:05.690 --> 00:03:09.120
I can't believe the Insect-men attacked...

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:12.090
And the Insect Magistrate is here.

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:17.900
But even though summer is over, 
is her body's poison safe?

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:23.430
Late yesterday afternoon, 
the Insect-man appeared in Edo.

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:26.790
It claimed many lives, but...

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:31.940
Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.360
I see... The Magistrate's Office defeated it.

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:42.660
Could the Office not defeat it 
before the damage spread?

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:45.460
They performed admirably.

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:48.150
The army that engaged them three years ago,

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:50.700
in the Oosaka expedition, was destroyed.

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:55.210
A single Insect-man,
 Mouri Katsunaga, defeated them.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:00.900
This report says it called
 itself Sarutobi Sasuke.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:02.340
Sarutobi?

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:05.110
That's a retainer of Sanada Yukimura!

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:09.720
A century ago, both Mouri and Sanada died!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.390
I knew it...

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:15.060
They're spirits from a century ago!

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:18.950
Edo is finished...

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.010
Be not afraid!

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:25.610
We have the Insect Magistrate!

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:31.000
By sealing herself away, she has 
refreshed herself and her powers anew.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:36.880
With her mind and her powers, 
those insects are nothing to fear!

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:39.010
Yes.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:42.380
Leave everything to me.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.660
That's wonderful!

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:47.530
Indeed...

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:50.340
We have the Insect Magistrate on our side!

00:04:56.650 --> 00:05:01.090
Princess, I apologize for having 
involved you in such a farce,

00:05:01.090 --> 00:05:03.820
even if we did need 
to keep the ministers calm.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.480
Do not concern yourself.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:07.980
It was nothing.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.580
However, even now, you...

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.550
The insects, the Insect-men...

00:05:15.550 --> 00:05:20.710
Their appearance is entirely my responsibility.

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.850
I may have lost my power,

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:28.220
but I am willing to sacrifice
 my life to end this!

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:30.720
<i>How noble...</i>

00:05:31.820 --> 00:05:35.300
<i>With her tiny, fragile body,</i>

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:39.290
<i>how much of her life has she abandoned?</i>

00:05:39.290 --> 00:05:41.550
<i>How much has she suffered?</i>

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:48.890
Princess, actually...

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.450
No, never mind.

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:58.800
<i>I can say no more.</i>

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:01.460
Let me go! I said to let me go!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.300
Stop this, Ieshige-sama!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:05.410
Don't stand in my way!

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.750
Tell me what was said about the insects

00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.400
in the conference you just held!

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:13.830
But that meeting was secret...

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:14.970
I don't care!

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.990
I'm doing this for Jinbei!

00:06:18.030 --> 00:06:20.600
I must tell Jinbei!

00:06:21.590 --> 00:06:23.070
Who is that?

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:25.110
It must be my son, Ieshige.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:28.910
Jinbei... I must tell Jinbei!

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:29.920
Tsukishima?

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.880
Princess, you know the man

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:36.520
of the Magistrate's Office 
called Tsukishima Jinbei?

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:45.030
<i>I never expected to see that 
expression on the Princess's face.</i>

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:50.870
Lord Yoshimune, I would like 
to speak with your son.

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:53.140
With Ieshige?

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.140
<b>No Girls Allowed</b>

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:04.030
I never thought you'd come to 
see me, Insect Magistrate.

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:09.980
Did you gather all these, Ieshige-dono?

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:11.560
Indeed!

00:07:12.070 --> 00:07:16.600
This room contains all the 
wisdom of the ages.

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:21.170
And all this knowledge helps me grow wise.

00:07:21.770 --> 00:07:22.770
What's this?

00:07:24.010 --> 00:07:28.460
That is a collection of legends of 
monsters from Hidatakayama.

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:31.930
Legends of monsters...

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:41.610
<i>This girl is trying to steal my knowledge,</i>

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.140
<i>but I won't let her!</i>

00:07:43.560 --> 00:07:44.940
<i>I have it!</i>

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:50.690
<i>Instead, I'll take all your knowledge.</i>

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:54.450
<i>Yes, I'm doing all this for Jinbei!</i>

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:57.200
I'm here for one reason.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:02.580
I wish to know your relationship 
to Tsukishima Jinbei.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:08.080
H-How do you know Jinbei?

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.260
He works at the Magistrate's Office.

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.840
We're connected.

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.380
<i>Connected?!</i>

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.730
<i>B-But then, why ask me about Jinbei?</i>

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:23.950
Your rank is not such that

00:08:23.950 --> 00:08:26.220
you should associate with 
Tsukishima Jinbei, either.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:32.440
Have you been lying about your 
position to meet with him?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:35.160
Wh-What of it?

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:37.180
I see...

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:42.450
If you lie about your status, 
you can still have a relationship.

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:45.900
<i>So that's it...</i>

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:50.880
<i>Like me, she cannot tell 
Jinbei her true identity.</i>

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:55.480
Very well! That changes things.

00:08:55.480 --> 00:08:56.880
Follow me.

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.260
In a way, you and I are comrades...

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.890
I have something to show you.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:12.200
From here, you can clearly 
see the Magistrate's Office.

00:09:12.200 --> 00:09:16.970
I watch Jinbei every day from this place...

00:09:18.770 --> 00:09:21.320
<i>So he's the next Shogun?</i>

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.790
<i>I fear for the future.</i>

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:23.850
Oh, look... He tripped!

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:26.390
Wh-What?!

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:27.450
What's wrong?

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.170
Has something happened to Tsukishima?

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:32.170
No! Impossible!

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:35.990
I'm s-sorry...

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:37.500
I tripped...

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.930
I'm g-glad you're all right.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:44.090
I'm jealous, kid.

00:09:44.090 --> 00:09:47.920
Jeez... Tsukishima, what are you doing?

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:50.460
You wanted to hear what 
happened while you were away.

00:09:50.460 --> 00:09:52.050
That's why we're here.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:54.630
I'm s-so sorry...

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:59.320
So what did you all do 
during your vacation?

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:02.440
I went to the ninja village to train,

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.660
and worked on some
 new kinds of explosives.

00:10:04.990 --> 00:10:06.720
Nothing special here.

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:09.510
I was getting rusty,

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:13.550
so I found all the major bandits 
in the area and cut them up.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:16.800
I... It's a secret.

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.050
That's just wonderful!

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.810
I must work harder, too!

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.790
That's right...

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:30.010
These people are too good for you.

00:10:30.010 --> 00:10:31.380
F-Father?

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.820
How long have you been here?

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:35.200
From the way you move,

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:37.440
you must be from Kishuu, right?

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:39.330
I see!

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:43.520
So you believe a true master of the blade 
should be able to slice anything.

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:47.810
I'd heard that Tsuchimikado wasn't 
nearly as strong as it once was,

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.710
but you're quite powerful for your age.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:55.410
Someday, I'd love to have 
the chance to fight you.

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.940
Jinbei-sama... Everyone...

00:11:01.940 --> 00:11:03.850
Would you like some more tea?

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.230
S-Splendid!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:13.860
Miss, would you like to marry my son?

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:15.980
M-Marry him?

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:17.970
F-Father?

00:11:17.970 --> 00:11:21.170
You're so beautiful... Please! Please!

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:24.290
U-Um, but I...

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:26.240
It's so sudden...

00:11:28.570 --> 00:11:30.950
Isn't that nice, Tsukishima?

00:11:30.950 --> 00:11:34.750
Miss, there's no dumpling on that stick.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.400
What is it?

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:40.010
Is that peach-boob woman 
trying to trick Jinbei again?!

00:11:40.710 --> 00:11:45.650
Come to think of it, I met my wife, 
Kanae, in Edo, as well.

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:48.720
You met your wife here?

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:51.140
I'd love to hear about it.

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:53.930
You met my mother in Edo?

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.170
Father...

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:01.900
I realize I don't know much of my mother.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:03.470
Oh...

00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:07.660
By the time you were old enough to 
recognize faces, she wasn't around.

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:12.550
Please tell me... What was she like?

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:16.590
If I close my eyes, I can still see her.

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:17.670
Kanae...

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:21.930
She was another sword fighter 
who aspired to be Japan's best.

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:26.550
And she had incredibly huge cans, too!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:31.410
<i>Did he remember his wife after 
seeing this girl's breasts?</i>

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:32.840
<i>What scum...</i>

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:34.310
<i>He's scum.</i>

00:12:34.710 --> 00:12:39.260
That was about sixteen years ago.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:41.070
You're going to keep going?!

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:43.780
We met in Edo,

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:48.580
<b>16 Years Earlier</b>

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:47.750
when we were both training with the sword.

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:53.580
<i>I am Tsukishima Genjuurou, of Tsugaru!</i>

00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:56.750
<i>I am Kanae, of Hidatakayama.</i>

00:12:57.490 --> 00:13:01.460
<i>I'd heard that Edo had an invincible swordsman.</i>

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:05.340
<i>I didn't expect it to be a slender, 
elegant lady like you.</i>

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:08.970
<i>I'd heard the same rumors.</i>

00:13:09.270 --> 00:13:13.350
<i>But I didn't expect it to be such 
a wimpy, insect-like man.</i>

00:13:15.950 --> 00:13:20.150
We could both tell at a glance that 
the other was a splendid fighter.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.360
A single moment's weakness 
would cost my life.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.770
We both looked for the moment to strike,

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:28.850
and then...

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.370
And so, we got married.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.050
The end.

00:13:38.050 --> 00:13:40.390
Huh?! How?

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:42.380
You left out some steps.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:48.010
<i>She was a crazy girl.</i>

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.350
<i>Taste my special attack!</i>

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:55.280
Tsukishima-style: Mt. Fuji Hammer!

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:58.770
<i>Wh-What power...</i>

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:00.420
<i>I'll end this here!</i>

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:01.730
Tsukishima-style...

00:14:05.100 --> 00:14:06.200
Tsukishima-style...

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:16.660
<i>Wh-What's happening?!</i>

00:14:22.400 --> 00:14:26.150
She stole my technique after seeing it once?

00:14:26.150 --> 00:14:27.880
<i>What skill!</i>

00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:33.970
<i>I didn't expect that you'd be 
able to keep up with me!</i>

00:14:43.430 --> 00:14:46.820
<i>I've never had so much fun, Tsukishima Genjuurou!</i>

00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:50.610
<i>Me, neither, Kanae!</i>

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:57.330
<i>Wh-What are they?</i>

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:17.980
<i>I've decided, Genjuurou...</i>

00:15:20.150 --> 00:15:21.980
<i>How about the name "Jinbei"?</i>

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:24.230
<i>I like it!</i>

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:27.430
<i>He's our child...</i>

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:30.120
<i>He'll grow up to be a healthy, strong boy.</i>

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:35.690
<i>I'm sure the days we spend teaching</i>

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:39.020
<i>our son to fight will be joyous ones...</i>

00:15:40.070 --> 00:15:42.960
H-He proposed as they fought?

00:15:42.960 --> 00:15:45.190
That sounds like Tsukishima's dad...

00:15:45.190 --> 00:15:46.740
That's a wonderful story!

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:51.380
So who ended up winning?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:55.950
We fought for another year, 
but it never ended...

00:15:55.950 --> 00:15:58.020
A y-year?

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:00.810
And during that time, Jinbei was born.

00:16:02.700 --> 00:16:05.810
Wh-What? What? What?

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.840
That's pretty surprising...

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:12.040
I had no idea my mother and father 
were such amazing people.

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:15.420
I'm so fired up!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.400
I must get started!

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:21.540
I need to be stronger,
 like my mother and father!

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:27.760
<i>We never did get to raise him together,</i>

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:31.550
<i>but don't worry, Kanae.</i>

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:32.890
<i>He's a dumb kid,</i>

00:16:32.890 --> 00:16:35.490
<i>but he's growing up just the way you'd hoped.</i>

00:16:39.110 --> 00:16:40.310
What's wrong?

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:41.810
Are you done?

00:16:42.780 --> 00:16:46.060
Ieshige-dono, I want to ask you something.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:47.560
What?

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:52.190
If Lord Yoshimune were going to hide 
a treasure, where would he hide it?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.480
A treasure?

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:56.620
You can't be after the Tokugawa's buried treasure,

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.580
said to be hidden in the Akagi Mountains!

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:02.050
I've no interest in gold.

00:17:02.670 --> 00:17:06.460
What I want to know is a 
legend about the insects.

00:17:06.930 --> 00:17:08.250
A legend?

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.980
A legend about the insects...

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.470
I might know just the place!

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:17.560
No! No! No! No! No! No!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:18.900
This is it!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:23.510
This is the information I attained by sneaking 
into the Insect Magistrate's library.

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:26.780
They said to forget everything I'd seen,

00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:28.980
but I would not do that!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:35.340
Using my memory, I made an exact replica!

00:17:36.780 --> 00:17:38.180
And look!

00:17:38.180 --> 00:17:41.960
The insect's sign is written 
all over western Japan.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:44.290
But east of Kishuu, no mark is made!

00:17:44.760 --> 00:17:48.840
That is because Kishuu is our greatest 
defense against the insects.

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:52.740
I don't know this legend of which you speak,

00:17:52.740 --> 00:17:55.440
but if my father were going
 to hide some treasure,

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:58.890
he'd put it as far away 
from the insects' advance as possible:

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:03.430
here, the distant land of Ezo!

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.900
<b>Insect</b>

00:18:07.380 --> 00:18:08.810
Kishuu, then?

00:18:16.340 --> 00:18:18.860
Sarutobi Sasuke's body has disappeared?

00:18:19.630 --> 00:18:20.640
Yes.

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:23.650
Someone seems to have taken it.

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.870
Could it have been the other Insect-men?

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:38.380
I-It appears I underestimated the enemy,

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:39.890
but I'm safe now.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.390
What are you talking about, weakling?

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:49.170
Why would I save you?

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:53.320
I merely wished to avoid 
giving them information.

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:55.640
S-Stop it...

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.600
Kirigakure Saizou, you...

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:04.170
Don't make me waste effort on you,

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:07.370
<b>Ten Crucifix Insects 
Kirigakure Saizou</b>

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:07.370
you dung beetle.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:10.370
I must also hurry...

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:14.180
To Kishuu, where Yukimura-sama awaits.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:20.880
So why did you wish to speak with me?

00:19:21.190 --> 00:19:24.360
Regarding a way to regain my power.

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:28.390
There is no time to waste.

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:31.340
You know that.

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.400
B-But...

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:37.820
<b>Insect</b>

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.150
Kishuu, isn't it?

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:48.880
You will tell me everything 
you know, Lord Yoshimune.

00:19:52.240 --> 00:19:53.500
Y-Yes.

00:19:56.680 --> 00:20:03.400
Then, to regain my power, 
I must go to that well myself, yes?

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:04.330
Yes.

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:06.390
I understand.

00:20:06.390 --> 00:20:09.230
Then I shall leave at once.

00:20:09.230 --> 00:20:10.520
A moment.

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:15.560
We don't know what threat 
awaits on the road...

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.690
With your power gone,

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.950
heading there alone would be wrong.

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:27.950
If you're going in secret, 
I ask that you take me,

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:32.800
Oooka Echizen no Kamitadasuke, 
of the Edo Southtown Magistrate's.

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:34.530
Who are you?

00:20:34.530 --> 00:20:36.690
Princess, as you know,

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.070
Oooka is one of my most trusted men.

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:43.830
The smartest man in Edo, 
and a master of the blade.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:48.610
He will be the perfect guard for you.

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:49.550
All right.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.230
Then I'd prefer that another

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:55.380
from the Insect Magistrate's accompany me.

00:20:58.850 --> 00:21:00.730
How much longer?

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:05.530
Kotori-dono told me to hurry here, 
to wait for someone...

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:09.280
But I don't see anyone 
who looks like the right person.

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:12.030
I may have gotten the place wrong.

00:21:12.030 --> 00:21:13.350
Do not worry.

00:21:13.350 --> 00:21:14.750
I am already here.

00:21:18.880 --> 00:21:20.140
You are...

00:21:20.140 --> 00:21:21.660
That servant!

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:24.760
Let us go to Kishuu.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.150
T-To Kishuu?!

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.770
<b>Next Time</b>

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:02.770
I keep my mind and body pure at all times,

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:04.910
so that I may meet the Magistrate.

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:08.870
Yes, you could say they're like 
Hibachi-dono's pure white fundoshi.

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:10.030
Don't say that!

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:11.820
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:14.000
The Cool Guy in Glasses 
Lectures on Right and Wrong.

00:23:11.820 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>The Cool Guy in Glasses
 Lectures on Right and Wrong</b>
